# Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge

We pledge to make participation in this project a harassment-free experience
for everyone and to act in ways that contribute to an open, welcoming, diverse,
inclusive, and healthy community.

## Our Standards

Examples of behavior that contributes to a positive environment include:

- Demonstrating empathy and kindness
- Respecting differing opinions and experiences
- Giving and accepting constructive feedback
- Accepting responsibility for mistakes
- Focusing on what is best for the community

Unacceptable behavior includes harassment, discrimination, personal attacks,
unwelcome sexual language or imagery, publishing private information without
permission, and other conduct that would be inappropriate in a professional
setting.

## Enforcement

Report unacceptable behavior to {{ user_email }}. Project maintainers will
review reports promptly and fairly while respecting the reporter's privacy.

This code is adapted from the [Contributor Covenant][covenant].

[covenant]: https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct.html
